      "change": "Refined the rule for including labels: only include the label if the paper uses a non-standard term, otherwise provide just the count/percentage."
    },
    {
      "column": "Mode of metastases - N (%) | Metachronous | Control",
      "definition": "What is the count and percentage of patients in the control arm who had metachronous (recurrent) metastatic disease? Include the value as stated (e.g., '82 (12.5%)'). Include the paper's label only if it uses a non-standard term for metachronous disease. Use 'Not reported' if the count/percentage is not available.",
      "change": "Refined the rule for including labels: only include the label if the paper uses a non-standard term, otherwise provide just the count/percentage."
    },
    {
      "column": "Median Age (years) | Treatment",
      "definition": "What is the median age, in years, of patients in the treatment arm? Include the interquartile range (IQR) or range if reported alongside the median. If only the median is reported, include only the median. Use 'Not reported' if the median age is not stated, including cases where only mean age or age groups are reported.",
      "change": "Explicitly stated that mean age or age groups should result in 'Not reported', as only median age is accepted."
    },
    {
      "column": "Median Age (years) | Control",
      "definition": "What is the median age, in years, of patients in the control arm? Include the interquartile range (IQR) or range if reported alongside the median. If only the median is reported, include only the median. Use 'Not reported' if the median age is not stated, including cases where only mean age or age groups are reported.",
      "change": "Explicitly stated that mean age or age groups should result in 'Not reported', as only median age is accepted."
    }
  ]
}

